{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hands on sticks...</strong> You're one of them.\u00a0<strong>Things to hand out...</strong> There's a lot of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448930/extras/c85d18a2050a688619523fcc2f378467.avif?t=1757237581\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a short journey no hand on a stick has been on until now and never again. Rummage through things, avoid being slapped, and hand stuff out to other hands before they lose their patience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUMMAGE THROUGH STUFF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stick your hand in various piles to find what the greedy hands are wanting. You'll need to be quick or they'll become impatient and just leave without even waving goodbye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448930/extras/e819a9097503bff377c675bb0e6aaca0.poster.avif?t=1757237581\" width=632 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448930/extras/e819a9097503bff377c675bb0e6aaca0.webm?t=1757237581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448930/extras/e819a9097503bff377c675bb0e6aaca0.mp4?t=1757237581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEEP THE STUFF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your hand in danger to keep your stuff from falling on the floor, being slapped, or stolen by aliens in tiny UFOs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448930/extras/54028dbb0285acb611ef2dfe32e96dc2.poster.avif?t=1757237581\" width=632 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448930/extras/54028dbb0285acb611ef2dfe32e96dc2.webm?t=1757237581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448930/extras/54028dbb0285acb611ef2dfe32e96dc2.mp4?t=1757237581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HAND OUT THAT STUFF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gently pass it. Drop it. Launch it. Do what you must to give your fellow hands their stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448930/extras/e411c3b80b1e7b7db6fee6e2ab737d77.poster.avif?t=1757237581\" width=632 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448930/extras/e411c3b80b1e7b7db6fee6e2ab737d77.webm?t=1757237581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448930/extras/e411c3b80b1e7b7db6fee6e2ab737d77.mp4?t=1757237581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Made with love and tea.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Oops...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3448930/c67846f60ee44ccc81ec4f9f924d13519a1f9b52.jpg"},{"name":"Getting Saucy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3448930/f6a373c21b7d2bc9c7dedccd468c76d0ea8e8de2.jpg"},{"name":"Ducking Hell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3448930/cb7ae851c9e9534bab5cc9d2a057553c738b9d34.jpg"},{"name":"Recipe Pirate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3448930/5427d3f06ced5e6752930a4568c61a589329a424.jpg"},{"name":"Round of Applause","path":"ht